add('Garrett’s CLE–NYJ game total is 39.5 / team total 21.0, compared with DET–ARI 54.5 and Detroit 30.0. Metcalf’s game total is 43.5 / PIT 23.25, and Michael Wilson’s ARI implied total is 24.5. Garrett gets zero soft context adjustment. These recorded totals explain optimizer scoring, not a verified physiological or matchup disadvantage. In the tight forced lineup, St. Brown + Mayer are replaced by Garrett + LaPorta; the correlated ARI–DET receiver pairing is preserved via LaPorta, so there is no correlation loss. The package costs +$100, loses 2.0497 mean and only 0.4999 summed P90 (TE calibration offsets matter), giving the small 0.034680461 gap.\n')
